    "content": "[vc_row][vc_column][woodmart_title size=\"medium\" font_weight=\"600\" tag=\"h1\" woodmart_css_id=\"66f8647c24dd8\" title=\"Explore Realistic 3D Models of the Planets for Scientific and Creative Projects\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NmY4NjQ3YzI0ZGQ4Iiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfdGl0bGUiLCJkYXRhIjp7InRhYmxldCI6e30sIm1vYmlsZSI6e319fQ==\" after_color=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfY29sb3JwaWNrZXIiLCJjc3NfYXJncyI6eyJjb2xvciI6WyIgLnRpdGxlLWFmdGVyX3RpdGxlIl19LCJzZWxlY3Rvcl9pZCI6IjY2Zjg2NDdjMjRkZDgiLCJkYXRhIjp7ImRlc2t0b3AiOiIjZGQ5OTMzIn19\" title_custom_color=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfY29sb3JwaWNrZXIiLCJjc3NfYXJncyI6eyJjb2xvciI6WyIgLndvb2RtYXJ0LXRpdGxlLWNvbnRhaW5lciJdfSwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NmY4NjQ3YzI0ZGQ4IiwiZGF0YSI6eyJkZXNrdG9wIjoiIzdhOWM1OSJ9fQ==\"][vc_separator style=\"shadow\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][woodmart_text_block woodmart_css_id=\"66f864f00c35f\" woodmart_inline=\"no\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NmY4NjRmMDBjMzVmIiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfdGV4dF9ibG9jayIsImRhdGEiOnsidGFibGV0Ijp7fSwibW9iaWxlIjp7fX19\" parallax_scroll=\"no\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"]\r\n<h2><strong>High-Quality 3D Planet Models for Download</strong></h2>\r\nBring the wonders of the solar system to life with our <strong>high-quality 3D models</strong> of the planets. Whether you're a teacher, student, or 3D artist, these models are perfect for educational and creative projects. Designed with <strong>realism</strong> and attention to detail, each model faithfully represents the unique characteristics of the planets, from <strong>Mercury</strong> to <strong>Neptune</strong>.\r\n<h3><strong>Why Choose Our Planet Models?</strong></h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li><strong>Realistic Features</strong>: Each 3D planet model is crafted with intricate details to provide an authentic representation.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Diverse Formats</strong>: Download in multiple formats including <strong>FBX</strong>, <strong>OBJ</strong>, and <strong>C4D</strong> for flexibility across various platforms.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Optimized for Various Projects</strong>: Whether it's for a <strong>school project</strong>, <strong>scientific visualization</strong>, or <strong>creative artwork</strong>, our planet models are designed to meet your needs.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n[/woodmart_text_block][woodmart_image img_align=\"center\" rounding_size=\"\" woodmart_css_id=\"66e96edc77ea9\" display_inline=\"no\" parallax_scroll=\"no\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NmU5NmVkYzc3ZWE5Iiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfaW1hZ2UiLCJkYXRhIjp7InRhYmxldCI6e30sIm1vYmlsZSI6e319fQ==\" woodmart_box_shadow=\"no\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\" img_id=\"18121\" img_size=\"full\"][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row][vc_column][woodmart_text_block woodmart_css_id=\"66f8651cd7521\" woodmart_inline=\"no\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NmY4NjUxY2Q3NTIxIiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfdGV4dF9ibG9jayIsImRhdGEiOnsidGFibGV0Ijp7fSwibW9iaWxlIjp7fX19\" parallax_scroll=\"no\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"]\r\n<h2><strong>Discover the Planets of the Solar System</strong></h2>\r\nExplore a wide range of models that include the <strong>Earth</strong>, with its beautiful oceans and continents, or venture further to <strong>Jupiter</strong>, the giant planet with its distinctive bands. Each model captures the essence of these celestial bodies in stunning detail.\r\n<ul>\r\n \t<li><strong>Mercury</strong>: The smallest and innermost planet.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Venus</strong>: With a thick atmosphere and bright surface.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Earth</strong>: Our home planet, accurately modeled with continents and oceans.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Mars</strong>: The red planet with detailed surface features.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Jupiter</strong>: A gas giant with iconic storm systems.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Saturn</strong>: Featuring stunning rings and moons.</li>\r\n \t<li><strong>Uranus &amp; Neptune</strong>: Ice giants with distinct atmospheric characteristics.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3><strong>Easy and Fast Download</strong></h3>\r\nYou can easily <strong>download</strong> any 3D planet model in just a few clicks. Our files are optimized for quick and seamless integration into your existing projects, without compromising on quality.[/woodmart_text_block][/vc_column][/vc_row][vc_row full_width=\"stretch_row\" css=\".vc_custom_1726574406252{background-color: #f8f8f8 !important;}\" woodmart_css_id=\"66e96f3ec0bec\" responsive_spacing=\"eyJwYXJhbV90eXBlIjoid29vZG1hcnRfcmVzcG9uc2l2ZV9zcGFjaW5nIiwic2VsZWN0b3JfaWQiOiI2NmU5NmYzZWMwYmVjIiwic2hvcnRjb2RlIjoidmNfcm93IiwiZGF0YSI6eyJ0YWJsZXQiOnt9LCJtb2JpbGUiOnt9fX0=\" mobile_bg_img_hidden=\"no\" tablet_bg_img_hidden=\"no\" woodmart_parallax=\"0\" woodmart_gradient_switch=\"no\" woodmart_box_shadow=\"no\" wd_z_index=\"no\" woodmart_disable_overflow=\"0\" row_reverse_mobile=\"0\" row_reverse_tablet=\"0\"][vc_column][vc_separator style=\"shadow\" css=\"\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"][vc_column_text css=\"\" woodmart_inline=\"no\" text_larger=\"no\"]\r\n<h3><strong>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</strong></h3>\r\n[/vc_column_text][woodmart_accordion][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"What file formats are offered for 3D planet models?\"]Our 3D planet models are available in C4D format, but if you need, we convert the model to one or more popular formats such as BLEND, OBJ and FBX. This will ensure compatibility with most 3D modeling software.[/woodmart_accordion_item][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"Can I use 3D planet models in commercial projects?\"]Yes, after purchase you get full rights to use the models in commercial and non-commercial projects.[/woodmart_accordion_item][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"Can I edit or modify 3D models?\"]Of course, our 3D planet models can be easily edited in any 3D modeling software. You can customize the models to your needs by changing their dimensions, textures and other parameters.[/woodmart_accordion_item][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"How quickly can I download 3D models after purchase?\"]Once your payment is complete, you will instantly have access to download the models. The download link will be sent to your email.[/woodmart_accordion_item][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"Do you provide support after purchase?\"]Yes, our support team is always available to help you with any questions or issues related to our 3D planet models. You can contact us via the feedback form on the website.[/woodmart_accordion_item][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"Are these 3D planet models free?\"]No, we do not offer <strong>free</strong> products. All of our <strong>3D models</strong> are high-quality, paid products that are created with precision for professional and educational use.[/woodmart_accordion_item][woodmart_accordion_item title=\"Can I find these models on Sketchfab?\"]No, our 3D models are not available on <strong>Sketchfab</strong>. We exclusively offer these models through our own store to ensure the best quality and customer service.[/woodmart_accordion_item][/woodmart_accordion][vc_separator style=\"shadow\" css=\"\" wd_hide_on_desktop=\"no\" wd_hide_on_tablet=\"no\" wd_hide_on_mobile=\"no\"][woodmart_button style=\"link\" size=\"extra-small\" icon_fontawesome=\"fas fa-caret-right\" icon_position=\"left\" woodmart_css_id=\"66e9732fbcc89\" title=\"3d print planet\" link=\"url:https%3A%2F%2Fshustrik-maps.com%2Fproduct-category%2Fcnc-models%2Fplanets%2F\" full_width=\"no\" button_inline=\"yes\" button_smooth